[agent] **1. Training run as a Vertex AI job** — Created and ran custom job `mlpab029ad4_trainjob6329cd` (logical name `trainjob6329cd`; display_name prefixed with `${MLPAB_GCP_PREFIX}_` per the isolation rule). It executed the **unmodified** `train_model.py` via `subprocess` inside a prebuilt Vertex training container, reading `train.csv`/`score.csv` from GCS and writing `predictions.csv` back to GCS. State: `JOB_STATE_SUCCEEDED`.
